# A quay: cobbles, planks and water, then a lamp and a barrel on top. The c line lists
# three cobbles, a variant list: each c cell draws one, picked from where it is.
# Each legend line is a character, then a file (and a frame) from this folder.
# The barrel has no dusk of its own, so %base keeps it in its base colors in a dusk scene.
c tiles.px:cobble/a tiles.px:cobble/b tiles.px:cobble/c
p tiles.px:planks
w tiles.px:water/0
L lamp.px+b
b barrel.px%base

